# Bot2 sacrifices Vampire Hexmage targeting Bot1's Paradise Mantle, which carries the hone counter Dwalin's entering put on it and
# is equipped to Dwalin (3/1). In response Bot1 destroys its own Mantle with Disenchant: the ability's only target is gone, so it
# does nothing (CR 608.2b) and leaves the stack, its cost already paid - Hexmage stays in the graveyard, and Dwalin is 2/1 with
# nothing attached.

